\cf5 \cb14 var\cf13  tile \cf5 =\cf13  tensor\cf5 .\cf13 tile\cf5 [\cf13 tile_size\cf5 ,\cf13  tile_size\cf5 ](\cf17 0\cf5 ,\cf13  \cf17 1\cf5 )\cf13 \cb1 \
