\cb14     DType\cf5 .\cf13 int16\cf5 ,\cf13 \cb1 \
\cb14     tile_layout\cf5 ,\cf13 \cb1 \
\cb14     MutAnyOrigin\cb1 \
\cf5 \cb14 ](\cf13 storage\cf5 .\cf13 unsafe_ptr\cf5 (),\cf13  buf_size\cf5 )\cf13 \cb1 \
\
\cf5 \cb14 for\cf13  i \cf5 in\cf13  \cf20 range\cf5 (\cf13 ceildiv\cf5 (\cf13 buf_size\cf5 ,\cf13  \cf5 comptime\cf13  \cf5 (\cf13 tile_layout\cf5 .\cf13 size\cf5 ()))):\cf13 \cb1 \
