\fs32 \cf2 To iterate over an existing tensor, call the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://docs.modular.com/stable/mojo/kernels/layout/layout_tensor/LayoutTensor/#tiled_iterator"}}{\fldrslt 
\fs28 \cf5 \cb12 \ul tiled_iterator()}} method, which produces a 
\fs28 \cf10 \cb12 LayoutTensorIter
